<h2>Not Just a Fast Class — A Record-Setting One</h2>
<p>Every combine produces a few standout sprinters. What made 2026 different is how broad the speed gains were. Rather than a handful of skill-position burners pulling up the average, the entire depth chart got faster — speed positions and line positions alike.</p>
<p>Seven position groups posted their fastest average 40-yard dash time in the history of the modern combine. That includes the offensive and defensive lines, positions where testing speed has historically moved the slowest year over year.</p>
